   You are currently using TransAmiga BBS v1.26 which will be the
   last public release of v1.x unless a serious bug is found.
   This version has been tested in many ways and on many systems,
   but there is no guarantee that it will work on your system
   without any problem. There are no known bugs. The next version
   will be a complete rewrite using C++.

   If you have any suggestions for things you'd like to see added to
   this version please let me know (although chances are you'd be
   able to add them yourself through its flexible ARexx interface),
   I'm quite open to new ideas.

   Thank you for your patience and enjoy the board!


   -Sami
